{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1153531-occ-hunter-the-vigil-2e-playtest-the-lucifuge-s-doubting-souls","id":1153531,"title":"[OCC] (Hunter: the Vigil 2e Playtest) The Lucifuge's Doubting Souls","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-27T10:48:52-07:00","id":1153531,"title":"[OCC] (Hunter: the Vigil 2e Playtest) The Lucifuge's Doubting Souls","content":"All right, let's get this show on the road! <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hupm73p7y1oK3qgBSvqggDhFkGfiAq2-hxFFPHakd28/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Here are the character sheets you will need</a>. Once everyone has indicated what character they would like to use, we can get an in-character thread up and running. A couple things to keep in mind:<ul><li>This scenario requires that Stephanie be one of the characters being played. If someone could pick her first, that would be awesome.</li> <li>Once characters are picked, I'll make an editable copy of the character sheets for this game and PM you the link.</li> <li>Some of the characters pick up additional powers over the course of the three scenes. Some of the characters don't. The scenario isn't trying to be unfair, so I just want you to bear in mind the progressions of characters is unique so that no one feels like they are getting the short end of the stick.</li> <li>PbP games are slow and we do have a fairly short time limit, so I am going to try and keep things moving as fast as possible, faster than I normally would with these games. If you don't think you can keep up with the pace, please let me know</li> <li>I'm not planning on continuing this game after the playtest, but it may happen. I'll make that call when we are done.</li> </ul>Also, does anyone know of a good dice roller online? I used to use Invisible Castle, but it seems to have disappeared some time ago?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-27T12:34:08-07:00","id":1153561,"title":"","content":"So the game is <i><b>not</b></i> in <i>Doubting Souls</i> Era? Cause they all seems much like modern characters...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-27T12:55:02-07:00","id":1153567,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1153531-occ-hunter-the-vigil-2e-playtest-the-lucifuge-s-doubting-souls?p=1153561#post1153561\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So the game is <i><b>not</b></i> in <i>Doubting Souls</i> Era? Cause they all seems much like modern characters...</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah it is. All of the characters work in Doubting Souls or in mordern times. I made a couple of tweeks to fit the eras better, but I don't have the time to completely overhaul back stories, and it I totally overhaul stats, this experiment in no longer useful to the Dev team. If you think I genuinely missed something, absolutely point it out, but note that I have zero intention of changing anyone's gender, the nature of Gabby and Steph's relationship, or Khalil's ethnicity. I'm not trying to be a tyrant, but I'm actually super busy at work right now, so I don't have the time or energy to put this up to debate. If you think there is a way to write a subtle twist into the character you pick, there should be plenty of space for you to fill out their backstory, and I fully encourage you to do so.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>